# StudyFlow MVP — Implementation Plan

AI-powered academic time management app for school & university students.  
Built on **Next.js 15 App Router · TypeScript strict · Tailwind CSS · shadcn/ui · Prisma · Supabase · Gemini 2.0 Flash**.

