### Phase 6 — AI Schedule Generation

#### [NEW] `lib/ai/scheduleGenerator.ts`
- `buildSchedulePrompt(data)` — exact template from Skill 4
- `callGemini(prompt)` — uses `@google/generative-ai`, reads `GEMINI_API_KEY` from env
- `parseAndValidateSchedule(raw)` — Zod validates the JSON Gemini returns
- `buildFallbackSchedule(data)` — rule-based fallback (no AI)

#### [NEW] `lib/services/ScheduleService.ts`
- `generateAndSave(userId)` — orchestrates prompt build → Gemini call → DB write
- `getActive(userId)` — fetches schedule + sessions with subject/topic joins
- Rate-limit check: queries last schedule creation time, rejects if < 10 min ago

#### [NEW] `app/api/schedule/generate/route.ts`
POST. Auth-gated, rate-limited (via `ScheduleService`). Deactivates previous active schedule before saving new one.

