## Verification Plan

### Automated Checks (run in order)

```bash
# Type safety
pnpm type-check          # zero TypeScript errors

# Lint
pnpm lint                # zero ESLint errors

# Build smoke test
pnpm build               # must complete without errors
```

> No existing test suite found (empty repo). I will not fabricate unit tests. Manual browser verification is the primary quality gate for this MVP phase.

### Manual Browser Verification

After `pnpm dev` starts at `http://localhost:3000`:

| # | Action | Expected Result |
|---|--------|-----------------|
| 1 | Visit `/register` → fill name, school email, password → submit | Account created, redirected to `/dashboard` |
| 2 | Sign out → visit `/dashboard` | Redirected to `/login` |
| 3 | Log in with credentials | Redirected to `/dashboard` |
| 4 | Navigate to **Subjects** → click Add → fill name/color → Save | New subject card appears |
| 5 | Expand subject → Add Topic → set progress to 60% | Progress bar on subject card updates |
| 6 | Navigate to **Exams** → Add exam linked to subject | Exam card shows with countdown |
| 7 | Navigate to **Schedule** → click **Generate Study Plan** | Loading spinner → calendar populates with color-coded sessions |
| 8 | Switch calendar to Week view | Sessions appear correctly in week grid |
| 9 | Click Generate again immediately | Rate-limit message shown (try again in X min) |
| 10 | Resize browser to 375px wide | All pages remain usable (mobile-first check) |
